<title>UK: Norway's Statfjord crude to load 29 cargoes in Jan.</title>
<headline>Norway's Statfjord crude to load 29 cargoes in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's Statfjord crude system is scheduled to load 29 cargoes in January, unchanged from December, traders said.</p>
<p>Statfjord crude is loaded offshore in 855,000-barrel shipments.</p>
<p>--London newsroom, +44 171 542 6280</p>
</text>
